    <tib>ye srid thog mtha' 'byung ba'i bder gshegs bskal pa'i grangs rtsis kyi mdo khro gnyen</tib>
    <skt/>
    <coloph>srid pa mu med pa'i bon la mkhas pa / bskal pa grangs med pa'i cho rab thon pa / lha gshen bskal srid thog mtha'i bon rgyud sel bur mkhyen pa'i / skos mkhan mu cho ldem drug gi 'gag med gsung gi bstan pa ru / dpe'u tser bkod nas bka' yi gnang bzhag go / e ma ho / thugs rje bzhi ldan 'gro mgon ston pa'i mchog / mkhyen rtse stobs ldan sprul sku khro gnyen gyi / srid pa stong rtsis bon rgyud gtan la phab / 'gro ba yongs la bka' gnang bzhag pa yang / slob ma dad ldan nam mkha' 'od zer gyis / 'gro ba yongs la tshig gis skul btab nas …</coloph>
